From 9e5a529a52416e5c63d2581fada1c730108e914b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 16:57:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add card-pack 3D reveal screen (React Native / Expo)

Ports the Claude Design handoff's tear-open foil pack
(grailhaus-pack.html + rip-pack.js + pack-art.js) to React Native for the
GrailHaus trial's Deliverable 1 (cards category only). Stack: three.js +
react-three-fiber on expo-gl for the real-time 3D and gesture-driven
deformation, @shopify/react-native-skia as the offscreen canvas standing
in for the DOM <canvas> the original texture generation needed,
expo-haptics for a sequenced haptic track. See README.md for the full
architecture writeup, the gesture-physics requirements this satisfies,
and an honest list of what's cut from this pass (no fallback 2D path, no
sequential per-card reveal, not run on physical hardware).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016WMQAFCTkz3Y9rb9UANYfA
